
### ====================================
### 16. OBTER BARREIRAS DE UM COE
### ====================================

GET https://localhost:7000/api/coe/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/barreiras
Accept: application/json

### ====================================
### OBSERVAÇÕES:
### ====================================
### - Ajuste a porta (7000) conforme sua configuração
### - Os GUIDs devem ser substituídos pelos IDs reais retornados pelo banco
### - Execute o script init.sql antes de testar
### - Os eventos publicados disparam automaticamente os observadores
### - As sagas podem ser iniciadas diretamente ou via eventos
### Orquestrador Saga Carteira COE - Exemplos de Requisições

### ====================================
### 1. CONSULTAR COEs CADASTRADOS
### ====================================

GET https://localhost:7000/api/coe
Accept: application/json

### ====================================
### 2. PUBLICAR EVENTO DE MTM (Simula Consumer)
### ====================================

POST https://localhost:7000/api/eventos/mtm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "dataReferencia": "2025-10-21"
}

### ====================================
### 3. INICIAR SAGA DE VALORIZAÇÃO MTM (Diretamente)
### ====================================

POST https://localhost:7000/api/saga/valorizacao-mtm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "dataReferencia": "2025-10-21"
}

### ====================================
### 4. PROCESSAR COTAÇÃO
### ====================================

POST https://localhost:7000/api/saga/processar-cotacao
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigoAtivo": "PETR4",
  "tipoAtivo": "ACAO",
  "dataReferencia": "2025-10-21",
  "precoAbertura": 38.20,
  "precoFechamento": 38.50,
  "precoMaximo": 38.80,
  "precoMinimo": 38.10,
  "volume": 15000000
}

### ====================================
### 5. PUBLICAR EVENTO DE COTAÇÃO
### ====================================

POST https://localhost:7000/api/eventos/cotacao
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigoAtivo": "PETR4",
  "precoFechamento": 38.50,
  "dataReferencia": "2025-10-21"
}

### ====================================
### 6. PUBLICAR EVENTO DE BARREIRA
### ====================================

POST https://localhost:7000/api/eventos/barreira
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "barreiraId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "coeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "tipoBarreira": "Autocall",
  "dataObservacao": "2025-10-21"
}

### ====================================
### 7. INICIAR SAGA DE AUTOCALL
### ====================================

POST https://localhost:7000/api/saga/autocall
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "barreiraId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "dataLiquidacao": "2025-10-25"
}

### ====================================
### 8. PUBLICAR EVENTO CORPORATIVO (SPLIT)
### ====================================

POST https://localhost:7000/api/eventos/evento-corporativo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventoId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
  "tipoEvento": "Split",
  "codigoAtivo": "PETR4",
  "fatorAjuste": 2.0
}

### ====================================
### 9. INICIAR SAGA DE EVENTO CORPORATIVO
### ====================================

POST https://localhost:7000/api/saga/evento-corporativo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventoId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
  "tipoEvento": "Split"
}

### ====================================
### 10. LISTAR TODAS AS SAGAS
### ====================================

GET https://localhost:7000/api/saga?pagina=1&tamanhoPagina=50
Accept: application/json

### ====================================
### 11. CONSULTAR SAGA ESPECÍFICA
### ====================================

GET https://localhost:7000/api/saga/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### ====================================
### 12. FORÇAR COMPENSAÇÃO DE UMA SAGA
### ====================================

POST https://localhost:7000/api/saga/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/compensar
Content-Type: application/json

### ====================================
### 13. EXECUTAR PRÓXIMA ETAPA (Debug)
### ====================================

POST https://localhost:7000/api/saga/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/executar-proxima-etapa
Content-Type: application/json

### ====================================
### 14. OBTER MTMs DE UM COE
### ====================================

GET https://localhost:7000/api/coe/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/mtms
Accept: application/json

### ====================================
### 15. OBTER POSIÇÕES DE CLIENTES
### ====================================

GET https://localhost:7000/api/coe/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/posicoes
Accept: application/json

